  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Boil the kettle.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water. Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 10-12 minutes.\n• Drain and return potato to the saucepan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687369cfa5a49c635d8ac3ee/step-43adbf00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice leek.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• To a small microwave-safe bowl, add the butter and microwave in 10 second bursts until melted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687369cfa5a49c635d8ac3ee/step-bb339310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the potato has 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook leek, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic, garlic & herb seasoning and the plain flour and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat, then add thickened cream, the water, Parmesan cheese, baby spinach leaves, cooked potato, lemon zest, and a squeeze of lemon juice.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes, stir to combine and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687369cfa5a49c635d8ac3ee/step-e2eba220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer filling to a baking dish.\n• Lightly scrunch each sheet of filo pastry (see ingredients) and place on top of potato mixture to completely cover. Gently brush melted butter over to coat.\n• Bake pie, until golden, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687369cfa5a49c635d8ac3ee/step-da84ea30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, in a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, snacking tomatoes, a squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687369cfa5a49c635d8ac3ee/step-0a884340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide cheesy potato and leek filo pie between plates. Serve with cherry tomato salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687369cfa5a49c635d8ac3ee/step-4d7ed850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
